│  **Madrid Travel Itinerary for 2026**                                                                         │
│                                                                                                               │
│  **February 14th, 2026 - Arrival Day**                                                                        │
│                                                                                                               │
│  * Morning: Arrive at Adolfo Suárez Madrid–Barajas Airport (MAD) from Vienna International Airport (VIE)      │
│          + Flight duration: Approximately 1.5 hours                                                           │
│          + Flight costs: $150-$250                                                                            │
│  * Afternoon: Check-in to Hotel NH Collection Madrid Palacio de Tepa, a 4-star hotel located in the heart of  │
│  Madrid                                                                                                       │
│          + Room rate: $120 per night                                                                          │
│          + Distance from airport: 15 km (9 miles), approximately 30 minutes by taxi or metro                  │
│  * Evening:                                                                                                   │
│          + Dinner at Botín, a renowned restaurant serving traditional Spanish cuisine                         │
│          + Explore the historic center and visit Plaza Mayor                                                  │
│                                                                                                               │
│  **February 15th, 2026 - Art and Culture Day**                                                                │
│                                                                                                               │
│  * Morning: Visit Museo del Prado, one of the world's greatest art museums                                    │
│          + Opening hours: 10:00 AM - 8:00 PM (free admission)                                                 │
│          + Must-see artworks: Velázquez's "Las Meninas" and Goya's "The Third of May 1808"                    │
│  * Afternoon:                                                                                                 │
│          + Lunch at Mercado de San Miguel, a lively food market offering a variety of tapas                   │
│          + Visit Reina Sofia Art Museum to see iconic works by Picasso, Dalí, and Miró                        │
│          + Explore the adjacent Sabatini Gardens for stunning views of the city                               │
│  * Evening: Enjoy traditional Spanish cuisine and live music at El Qu Jetcho                                  │
│                                                                                                               │
│  **February 16th, 2026 - Royal Palace and Departure Day**                                                     │
│                                                                                                               │
│  * Morning:                                                                                                   │
│          + Visit the Royal Palace of Madrid, an impressive example of Spanish royal architecture              │
│          + Guided tour: $10 per person (book in advance)                                                      │
│          + Duration: Approximately 1 hour                                                                     │
│  * Afternoon:                                                                                                 │
│          + Last-minute shopping at IFEMA exhibition center or Campo de las Naciones                           │
│          + Farewell lunch at a traditional tavern, such as El Tempranillo                                     │
│  * Departure:                                                                                                 │
│          + Return to Adolfo Suárez Madrid–Barajas Airport for your departure flight                           │
│                                                                                                               │
